er.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2122623882993795127", "start": 175, "url": "https://t.co/Cpa44NiRvW"}]}, "id": "2122624930617430065", "lang": "zh", "note_tweet": {"text": "我认为它值得长期研究。\n\n2026年上半年业绩：\n\n营收：1.166亿美元，同比增长283.1%。\n毛利润：2080万美元。\n毛利率：17.9%。\n调整后净亏损：2.93亿美元。  \n\n它有几个值得关注的方向：\n\n大模型：与 OpenAI、Anthropic 等公司竞争。\nAI Agent：未来企业级 AI 服务的商业化。\nAI 视频：海螺 AI 的全球市场潜力。\nAI Coding：开发者付费和 Token 消耗增长。\n\n但也有明显风险：持续亏损、算力成本、竞争加剧，以及后续融资带来的股权稀释。🤔🤔🤔"}, "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122623882993795127", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "我认为它值得长期研究。\n\n2026年上半年业绩：\n\n营收：1.166亿美元，同比增长283.1%。\n毛利润：2080万美元。\n毛利率：17.9%。\n调整后净亏损：2.93亿美元。  \n\n它有几个值得关注的方向：\n\n大模型：与 OpenAI、Anthropic 等公司竞争。\nAI Agent：未来企业级 AI 服务的商业化。\nAI 视频：海螺 AI https://t.co/Cpa44NiRvW", "url": "https://x.com/jerrychen0awi/status/2122624930617430065"}, {"attachments": {"poll_ids": ["2122687910180741120"]}, "author_id": "2105419048653619201", "conversation_id": "2122687913112510519", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:46:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122687913112510519"], "id": "2122687913112510519", "lang": "zh", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "为做 AI 视频，有人开了个月 4299 的即梦超级会员\n首月打完折一两千，第二个月起 4299，每月给 54600 积分，折下来大概能做 780 条 5 秒视频\n原帖配图里那个 4999 是包季的首季价，不是月费，别看错了\n问题来了：你是靠 AI 视频赚钱养会员，还是自己赚钱养 AI 视频", "url": "https://x.com/AI7Sir/status/2122687913112510519"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2122535030199336960"]}, "author_id": "748791326330630144", "conversation_id": "2122536028955410743", "created_at": "2026-11-17T03:43:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122536028955410743"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 57, "start": 52, "tag": "AI视频"}, {"end": 67, "start": 58, "tag": "Seedance"}, {"end": 73, "start": 68, "tag": "画蛇添足"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Kce1jKKn4Z", "end": 97, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/yixingtechnolo1/status/2122536028955410743/video/1", "media_key": "13_2122535030199336960", "start": 74, "url": "https://t.co/Kce1jKKn4Z"}]}, "id": "2122536028955410743", "lang": "zh", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "画蛇添足｜用即梦 Seedance 做的 AI 动画，剪辑和字卡后期添加。你给这条 AI 短片打几分？ #AI视频 #Seedance #画蛇添足 https://t.co/Kce1jKKn4Z", "url": "https://x.com/yixingtechnolo1/status/2122536028955410743"}, {"author_id": "1509087349061214208", "conversation_id": "2122680141713461422", "created_at": "2026-11-17T13:15:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122680141713461422"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/status/21226…", "end": 175, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/i/status/2122631078590415037", "start": 152, "url": "https://t.co/aP01N1edD1"}]}, "id": "2122680141713461422", "lang": "zh", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 96, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2122631078590415037", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "博主说：这条 67 秒、480P 的 Seedance 2.5 视频，一共花了他 132 块 5 毛 9🐳\n\n前天才充的 200 块会员，今天就宣布不玩了\n\n用户：AI 视频终于不用请剧组了！\n钱包：但你请了 Seedance 啊😅\n\n所以 AI 视频到底是在帮我们省钱，还是换个姿势让我们继续花钱？🤔 https://t.co/aP01N1edD1", "url": "https://x.com/DeepSeekNya/status/2122680141713461422"}, {"author_id": "1682658004540461056", "conversation_id": "2122545305950523637", "created_at": "2026-11-17T04:20:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2122545305950523637"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/BytePlusGlobal…", "end": 159, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BytePlusGlobal/status/2120760891344036304", "start": 136, "url": "https://t.co/zUs68L0dAr"}]}, "id": "2122545305950523637", "lang": "zh", "possibly_sensitive": false, "public_metrics":